cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its formal development, please cite it as
  below.
title: partial-audit-classification
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Duston
    family-names: Moore
    email: dhwcmoore@gmail.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/dhwcmoore/partial-audit-classification'
url: 'https://github.com/dhwcmoore/partial-audit-classification'
abstract: >-
  A Coq/Rocq-mechanised, extracted-to-OCaml classification kernel
  enforcing that no audit conclusion may depend on a material assertion
  whose verification state is undefined: boundary-specification-driven
  classification, certificate-based admission separation over a
  registered-process population, automatic and append-only residual
  emission for non-admitted material dependencies, and an executable
  opinion-decision procedure proved sound end to end.
keywords:
  - formal methods
  - audit
  - accounting information systems
  - Coq
  - Rocq
  - verification
